351 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 71 0 R/E(Strength-focused workouts benefit from a combination of carbohydrates and protein to support power and muscle engagement. Carbohydrates help fuel lifts and sets, while protein supports muscle tissue during training. The goal is steady energy without feeling overly full or sluggish.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

352 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 71 0 R/Pg 20 0 R/A[818 0 R 0]/K[9]>>
endobj

