<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 71 0 R/E(Cardio & Endurance Workouts)/Pg 20 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

354 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 71 0 R/E(Cardio and endurance sessions rely more heavily on carbohydrates for sustained energy. Lighter, carb-focused options can help support stamina and prevent early fatigue, especially during longer or higher-intensity workouts. Protein can be kept moderate, depending on workout length and intensity.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

