<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 71 0 R/E(Gentle movement requires less fuel and often feels best with lighter or simpler foods. A small snack or easily digestible option can support comfort and focus without weighing you down. Some people may feel comfortable training with minimal or no food for these sessions.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[14]>>
