endobj

375 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 72 0 R/E(Carbohydrates help restore glycogen, the stored energy used during workouts. Replenishing carbs after training supports energy levels, especially if you train frequently or have another workout planned. The amount needed depends on workout intensity, duration, and overall activity level.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

