<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 72 0 R/E(Fluids & electrolytes)/Pg 21 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

377 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 72 0 R/E(Fluids replace water lost through sweat and support circulation and temperature control. Electrolytes like sodium can be helpful after longer or sweat-heavy workouts. Staying hydrated throughout the day supports recovery better than relying on a single post-workout drink.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

