421 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 75 0 R/E(Healthy fats support hormone health, nutrient absorption, and overall nourishment. While fats aren\220t the main focus right before workouts, including them in meals before or after training helps create balanced, satisfying meals. Focus on whole-food, unsaturated fat sources rather than processed ones.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[1]>>
