427 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 75 0 R/E(What you eat around your workouts plays an important role in how your body feels, performs, and recovers. Choosing nutrient-dense, minimally processed foods helps support steady energy during training and effective recovery afterward. Simple, whole-food choices can make workouts feel better and recovery more comfortable over time.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[7]>>
