445 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(Carbohydrates provide fuel for workouts and help restore energy after exercise. Choosing whole, fiber-rich carbohydrate sources supports steady energy levels and recovery without sharp ups and downs. These foods help your body feel supported both during and after training.)/Pg 25 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

