endobj

611 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 83 0 R/E(Pre & Post Workout Nutrition Guide | 23 )/Pg 32 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

612 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 83 0 R/E(There is no single \215right\216 way to eat around workouts. Energy levels, digestion, schedule, and preferences all matter. Flexible choices, consistency over time, and listening to your body create better results than strict rules.)/Pg 32 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

